      "message": "B708 retain authenticated rank75 root negatives; activate B709 rank89 original flops and repair B704 flop-only runtime price guard\n\nPreserve all 150 CERT-MULTIBOARD and 242 APPROX records. B708 replays three original root negatives without native reruns; no locks or medium boards are added by those negatives. B709 seeks the third distinct reachable rank89 flop using unchanged GTO and measured NL2 gates. B704 candidate activation fixes the production loader that rejected authentic checked-flop turn-call routes; require full audits and exactly three reviewed code blobs before publishing any live price change.\n\nKeep PR #2 draft; do not merge.",
